      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Top Down View Ramp Jump\nCalculate horizontal ramp angle intervall\nGoal: Hit crane between pivot and boom end\n-> Evaluate angle between limiting curves (green area)\nRed: Launch origin / crane pivot || Green: Crane Boom + Weight \nOrange: flattest and steepest drive-up angle => defining tolerance\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Top Down View Ramp Jump\nCalculate horizontal ramp angle intervall\nGoal: Hit crane between pivot and boom end\n-> Evaluate angle between limiting curves (green area)\nRed: Launch origin / crane pivot || Green: Crane Boom + Weight \nOrange: flattest and steepest drive-up angle => defining tolerance\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
